ES:
¡Por todas las olas de levante!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}¡Pero si eres ni más ni menos que{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}{{TAG:0005:0000:}}, nuestro querido alcalde!
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}¡Jo, jo, jo! {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}El viejo {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Tórtimer {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}ha
pasado el timón a un pezqueñín{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Bah, no me hagas caso. ¡Hablo solo!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0011:}}Nom d'un calmar géant !{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
Mais c'est l'pavillon du maire ça !{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Cap'taine {{TAG:0005:0000:}}, je présume.
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}Cette vieille baderne de {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Tortimer{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
a dû boire la tasse quand son rafiot
a coulé{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}C'que j'veux dire ?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} Bah,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} fais pas
attention aux divagations d'un vieux
loup d'mer...

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}A un servidor lo llaman el {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Capitán{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Me dedico a transportar pasajeros
entre la {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}isla y tierra firme.

{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Si alguna vez te apetece surcar {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
el océano, pásate a hablar conmigo,
bonito en escabeche.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Di' un po', gamberetto...{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Ti andrebbe un viaggetto sull'isola?
Posso portarti io!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Adaya deniz yolculuğu canın
çekerse{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
buraya koşuver, minik karides sandviçi!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}¿Cómo dices?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} {{TAG:0003:0000:}}¿Que tienes {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}1000{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}bayas {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}de sobra para pagar el
trayecto de ida y vuelta a la isla?{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
¡Sí, capitán!
No, soy pobre

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Come dici, gamberetto?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Vuoi che ti porti sull'isola?{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Sì, per favore!
No, grazie!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Sabía que caerías en mis redes,
boquerón de marea baja.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0000:}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}El viaje de ida y vuelta a la isla
cuesta {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}1000 bayas{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}, marinero.{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
¿Levamos anclas?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
¡Sí!
¡No!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Cosa c'è, gamberetto?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Che ti prende?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Hai dimenticato qualcosa?{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Torniamo sull'isola!
Lascia stare.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Muy bien, pero antes...{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
¿te importa vaciar el cesto
del muelle, grumetillo?

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Prima di tutto, gamberetto,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} devi
svuotare il {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}cesto ritiro oggetti{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
sul molo. OK?

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}So I can ferry yer mate from this
town too, but be that OK?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
Yer fine with that, yar?{{TAG:000D:0008:02CD}}{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Sure.
Nope.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Si tu veux, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}j'peux aussi faire monter
ton marin d'eau du robinet d'copain.{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
Qu'est-ce que tu dirais d'ça ?{{TAG:000D:0008:02CD}}{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Ouaip !
Nan !

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Ich schipper auch deine Kameraden
übern Teich, wenn ich soll. {{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
Soll ich?{{TAG:000D:0008:02CD}}{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Klar.
Nein.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Bu kasabadaki arkadaşını da
götürebilirim, ama senin için sorun yok, değil
mi?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
Olur mu?{{TAG:000D:0008:02CD}}{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Olur.
Olmaz.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}We'll be shovin' off here soon...{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
but only with a full boat, yar?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Get to invitin' yer landlubber friend{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
so we can pull anchor!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Partiremos enseguida, grumete...{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
pero solo con el bote lleno, ¿eh?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Invita a un marinerillo más{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
y levaremos anclas.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Yar, we can be leavin' anytime...{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Anytime we gots a full boat!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Tell all yer wee friends to look
lively{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} an' get on board!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Jarrr, der Anker wird gelichtet,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
sobald das Boot voll ist!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Also los, {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}pack deine Kameraden ein,
zack, zack!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Yar, I forgot to tell ye this but{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}
I can't take ye to the island {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}unless
the ticket gates be closed.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Se me olvidó un pequeño detalle{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}
No puedo llevarte a la isla{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} hasta que
no cierren la taquilla.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Say now, me wee crab cruncher,{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001C:}}who do ye plan on spendin' time
with on the island? {{TAG:000D:0008:02CD}}{{TAG:000F:0006:000000000000}}
No one!
Other travelers.
Abandon ship!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}E allora, mio carissimo girino,{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001C:}}con chi giocherai sull'isola?{{TAG:000D:0008:02CD}}{{TAG:000F:0006:000000000000}}
Da solo!
Con altri viaggiatori.
Ho cambiato idea!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0007:}}Gar, what cheekiness be this?!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Do ye just like barkin' for no
reason like a sea dog, then?

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0007:}}¡¿Así que te haces el bucanero, eh?!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Los auténticos marineros no se
echan atrás.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Jarrrharrr, {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}da sind wir schon!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Was biste denn so grün um
die Kiemen?{{TAG:0007:0009:20000000}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Per tutti i merluzzi!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Non hai le {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}1000 stelline{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Mi spiace, ma non posso portarti.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Ye ready to set off fer the island?{{TAG:000D:0008:02CD}}{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Yes!
Not yet.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿Listo para partir rumbo a la isla?{{TAG:000D:0008:02CD}}{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
¡Sí!
Aún no

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Paré à lever l'ancre ?{{TAG:000D:0008:02CD}}{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Toutes voiles dehors !
On reste à quai.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Pronto per salpare, gamberetto?{{TAG:000D:0008:02CD}}{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Sì!
Non ancora!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Jarrr, biste bereit für die Insel?{{TAG:000D:0008:02CD}}{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Klar! Los doch!
Noch nicht ganz...

FR:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Tous les crabes sont dans la nasse ?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Hissez haut ! {{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}Larguez les amarres !{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
Levez l'ancre !{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} On prend le large
toutes voiles dehors !

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Sind wir dann alle so weit, jarrr?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Dann hoch mit dem Anker, und los
geht's!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Senin şu havalı{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Club Tortimer{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
üyelerinden olduğunu duydum.{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Anlaşılan siz{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}
Club Tortimer{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
tayfası adayı partileriniz
için ayırtabiliyormuşsunuz.
Daha da garibi,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} tanıdığın ya da
tanımadığın insanlarla gidebiliyormuşsun!{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Har
har har,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
seçimin ne?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} Tek başına mı, diğer{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}
Club Tortimer{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
üyeleriyle mi?{{TAG:000D:0008:02CD}}{{TAG:000F:0006:000000000000}}
Yalnız gideceğim.
Üyelerle gideceğim.
Vazgeçtim.

{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Yar{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}har{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}har!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Seni bu kadar sosyal
sanmazdım.{{TAG:0003:0000:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Pusulam bozulmuş demek.
Tanımadığın insanlarla denizlere
açılırken iki kural:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Kural 1:{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0007:000A:}}Terbiyeni takın!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Kural 2:{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0007:000C:}}{{TAG:0000:0002:7300}}TERBİYENİ TAKIN!{{TAG:0000:0002:6400}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}
İnsanları kıracak şeyler
söyleme. Maceracı yasasına aykırı!
Kişisel bilgilerini de dağıtma.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Yapma.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}{{TAG:0007:000C:}}{{TAG:0000:0002:7300}}YAPMA DEDİM!{{TAG:0000:0002:6400}}
Uygunsuz kıyafet ya da dil de
yok. Nar!
Başkaları hem{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}TPC{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} kartını hem{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}özel
tasarımlarını{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
görebilir; EN İYİ HÂLİNLE DAVRAN!
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Yar,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} bir şey daha{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Sen gidince{{TAG:0003:0025:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Club Tortimer{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
sahilini temizleriz.
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Sahilde bir şey unutursan{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} yar!
Gider!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}
Sevdiğin perukla paçavraları
kafanda tut evlat!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}
Hatta{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} değerli her şeyi evde
bırakmak en akıllısı.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Per tutti i merluzzi!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Non hai le {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}1000 stelline{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Mi spiace, ma non posso portarti.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Arrr! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Du hast keine {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}1.000 Sternis{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Geschenkt gibt's hier nichts, harrr!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Auch ein Seemann hat Ausgaben.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Et si on mettait un peu d'musique{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
pour rendre cette traversée encore
plus agréable ?{{TAG:000D:0008:02CD}}{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Et comment !
Oh, non...

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Di', gamberetto... Ti andrebbe
di sentire un po' di musica{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
per movimentare la traversata?{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Certo!
No, grazie.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Ouais ! C'est l'heure de chanter !{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Allez, chante avec moi, c'est pas la
mer à boire !

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}E allora, spieghiamo le vel...
ehm, le voci!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Ciurma, si canta!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Gar, o zaman denizci şarkıları
gelsin!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Biraz da... havalı olsun.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}La mer a fait de moi un homme,
moussaillon !{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} Enfin, euh...{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} J'me
comprends.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Hé, mais... {{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}On dirait qu'elle t'a fait
pousser du poil au menton ! Hé hé !{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
Tiens, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}reprends tes affaires.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Jarrrharrr, {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}zufrieden?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Hier ist übrigens dein Kram wieder.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ich bin sicher, es fehlt nichts...

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Yar har,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}iyi kaptanlık yaptım
ama, değil mi?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}
Bu arada, söz verdiğim gibi eşyaların.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Bald ist der alte Kahn wieder
seetauglich, keine Sorge.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Komm einfach später wieder.

